Use Windows.pkg
Use GlobalFunctionsProcedures.pkg
Use cXssMarkdownSanitizer.pkg

External_Function MarkdownTestsExitProcess "ExitProcess" Kernel32.dll Integer iExitCode Returns Integer

Object oMarkdownSanitizer is a cXssMarkdownSanitizer
End_Object

Procedure RunMarkdownSanitizerTests
    String sInput sOutput
    Boolean bFailed
    Integer iVoid

    Move ("first" + Character(10) + "second" + Character(10)) to sInput
    Get SanitizeMarkdown of oMarkdownSanitizer sInput to sOutput
    If (sOutput <> sInput) Begin
        Move True to bFailed
    End

    Move ("first" + Character(13) + Character(10) + "second") to sInput
    Get SanitizeMarkdown of oMarkdownSanitizer sInput to sOutput
    If (sOutput <> sInput) Begin
        Move True to bFailed
    End

    Move ("```dataflex" + Character(10) + "Move 1 to iValue" + Character(10) + "```") to sInput
    Get SanitizeMarkdown of oMarkdownSanitizer sInput to sOutput
    If (sOutput <> sInput) Begin
        Move True to bFailed
    End

    If (bFailed) Begin
        Move (MarkdownTestsExitProcess(1)) to iVoid
    End
    Else Begin
        Move (MarkdownTestsExitProcess(0)) to iVoid
    End
End_Procedure

Send RunMarkdownSanitizerTests
